the target language is: prolog.

the knowledge base hasagentrole includes these resources:
    lomo.

the knowledge base hasagentrole includes:

the text of the source description is at "sources/hasAgentRole.ttl".

% Who bears a duty: the agent of this role of the action (lomo.le).
the bearer role is addresser.


action inform commission is identified by "http://example.org/Action_InformCommission".

action inform commission has the agent role agent role ms informer.

action inform commission has the agent role agent role commission informed.


agent role ms informer is identified by "http://example.org/AgentRole_MS_Informer".

agent role ms informer is an agent role.

agent role ms informer is for the agent member states.

agent role ms informer has the role addresser.


agent role commission informed is identified by "http://example.org/AgentRole_Commission_Informed".

agent role commission informed is an agent role.

agent role commission informed is for the agent commission.

agent role commission informed has the role addressee.


action publish report is identified by "http://example.org/Action_PublishReport".

action publish report is an action.

action publish report has the agent role agent role commission publisher.


agent role commission publisher is identified by "http://example.org/AgentRole_Commission_Publisher".

agent role commission publisher is an agent role.

agent role commission publisher is for the agent commission.

agent role commission publisher has the role addresser.


% Things the description names but does not describe: their addresses.
member states is identified by "http://example.org/MemberStates".

commission is identified by "http://example.org/Commission".


% The questions of LOMO's requirements document (its competency questions),
% as far as a description can answer them.
scenario description is, as stated in the source description:
    actions_of_agents expects answers ["commission acts as addressee in action inform commission", "commission acts as addresser in action publish report", "member states acts as addresser in action inform commission"].

query applies is:
    which rule applies to which party.

query rules_without_conditions is:
    which rule has no written conditions.

query addressers is:
    which agent acts as addresser in which action.

query addressees is:
    which agent acts as addressee in which action.

query beneficiaries is:
    which agent acts as beneficiary in which action.

query kinds is:
    which thing is of the kind which kind.

query prescriptive is:
    which thing is a prescriptive rule.

query constitutive is:
    which thing is a constitutive rule.

query actions_of_agents is:
    which agent acts as which role in which action.

query parts is:
    which thing is part of the description.

query texts is:
    which thing is described by the text which text.

query addresses is:
    which thing is identified by which address.

query bearer is:
    the bearer role is which role.

